    <summary>Official silent installer for OctoWatch On-Premise Server — Windows EMS and endpoint DLP hosted on your infrastructure.</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[
## OctoWatch Server

**OctoWatch Server** is the On-Premise control plane for [OctoWatch DLP](https://octowatchdlp.com/) — Windows employee monitoring and endpoint data loss prevention from **KOLIBRI LLC**.

This Chocolatey package downloads the signed vendor installer and runs a silent Inno Setup deployment of Server components used for self-hosted environments: Admin Console, monitoring services, and Web Console hosting on customer Windows servers.

### Who it is for

Security, IT, and compliance teams that need workforce activity visibility and DLP enforcement while keeping monitoring data **on their own servers** (regulated industries, air-gapped or sovereignty requirements, preference for On-Prem over Cloud).

### Capabilities you unlock after Server is online

- Central console for Settings, Rules, Timetable, and Computer profiles
- Investigation workflows across activity channels and DLP **Risks** alerts
- Floating licenses by **active tracked users** (Web Console operators are unlimited)
- Deployment of Windows **Grabber** agents to workstations and Terminal Server / RDS sessions (Grabber is a separate installer issued from the console)

### What this package installs

- Downloads: `https://octowatchdlp.com/OWServerSetup.exe`
- Silent switches: `/VERYSILENT /SUPPRESSMSGBOXES /NORESTART /SP-`
- Does **not** embed the EXE in the `.nupkg` (official HTTPS download + SHA256)

### Requirements (read before installing)

- Windows machine with **administrator** rights
- **Internet** may be required so Windows can enable IIS features via DISM from Microsoft
- **Microsoft SQL Server 2014+** (Express is commonly used) — **not** installed by this package; prepare the database per the [documentation](https://octowatchdlp.com/docs/)
- After Server setup, install Grabbers from the Admin Console / Web Console workflow

### License and trial

This is **commercial shareware**. A **14-day free trial** (up to **15 users**) is available from the [download page](https://octowatchdlp.com/download/). Continued production use requires a purchased license — see [pricing](https://octowatchdlp.com/pricing/) and the [license agreement](https://octowatchdlp.com/license/).

### Disambiguation

OctoWatch DLP is business monitoring software for authorized employer use on company Windows endpoints. It is **not** Octo Browser and is not affiliated with antidetect browser products.

### Support

- Docs: https://octowatchdlp.com/docs/
- Product updates: https://octowatchdlp.com/category/updates/
- Contact / support: https://octowatchdlp.com/support/
]]></description>
